		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Mercurial scales cover this sleek, 50-foot-long dragon. Inquisitive about mortal life.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 bewildering breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bewildering Breath</strong>. A double near-size cube of shining moonlight extending from the dragon. WIS 15+ or dazed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Moonblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Dragon and riders can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Teleport</strong>. Teleport within distant.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
